    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your copy of Lost Ember for a small upgrade fee at release!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you buy the original version of Lost Ember now, you are eligible for a the special upgrade offer when the Rekindled Edition launches. <strong>Complete the main story of the base game now to be ready for the new content!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Rekindled Edition of the acclaimed adventure features not only improved visual fidelity powered by Unreal Engine 5, but also a continuation of the main story in a new map! Complete various soul quests in this new open world level  featuring all playable animals!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Owners of the original game will be able to upgrade for a small upgrade fee!</strong><br><br>Finish the main story of the base game now to be able to start into the new content right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Lost Ember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breathtakingly beautiful world holds the secrets of its past for you and your companion to uncover in this 5-hour journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.poster.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.webm?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.mp4?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the contrasting stories of the fall of mankind and the lush life in a world reclaimed by nature with a wolf as your main character and a determined companion at your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.poster.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.webm?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.mp4?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land, sea, and air, as you possess any creature you come across to experience life from a whole new perspective. Fly through gargantuan canyon valleys as a parrot! Tumble through the grass as a wombat! Swim through shimmering lakes as a fish! Your journey will take you from densely wooded jungles, to lush rainforest canopies, to barren desert plains and archaic temples. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/cfe3de674eb9bdf86cf97df0607044bc.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you'll discover a tale of loyalty, despair, and betrayal, as echoes of the lost Yanrana culture come to life in a lush wilderness devoid of man.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Rekindled Edition of the acclaimed adventure features not only improved visual fidelity powered by Unreal Engine 5, but also a continuation of the main story in a new map! Complete various soul quests in this new open world level  featuring all playable animals!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Owners of the original game will be able to upgrade for a small upgrade fee!</strong><br><br>Finish the main story of the base game now to be able to start into the new content right away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Lost Ember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breathtakingly beautiful world holds the secrets of its past for you and your companion to uncover in this 5-hour journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.poster.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.webm?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/942cf1cd69bd43abb55d89948db75a46.mp4?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the contrasting stories of the fall of mankind and the lush life in a world reclaimed by nature with a wolf as your main character and a determined companion at your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.poster.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.webm?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/15d08fb1a966f1e1374cd9e17688d280.mp4?t=1750948780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land, sea, and air, as you possess any creature you come across to experience life from a whole new perspective. Fly through gargantuan canyon valleys as a parrot! Tumble through the grass as a wombat! Swim through shimmering lakes as a fish! Your journey will take you from densely wooded jungles, to lush rainforest canopies, to barren desert plains and archaic temples. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086580/extras/cfe3de674eb9bdf86cf97df0607044bc.avif?t=1750948780\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you'll discover a tale of loyalty, despair, and betrayal, as echoes of the lost Yanrana culture come to life in a lush wilderness devoid of man.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore the acclaimed animal adventure in never before seen beauty with new content! Slip into the role of different animals to uncover the fate of an ancient world. Dive into deep waters, fly at lofty heights or even climb steep cliffs with a mountain goat, there are lots of ways of getting around.",
